nd where do they differ?\n     Maybe 4. Does repo documentation corroborate one route as verified vs unverified?\n   - Keep the ANCHORS intact for reducer.\n   - Non-goals: don't run keyed probes, don't edit patches, don't assess route health beyond declarations.\n   - Stop conditions: single iteration cap; answer unde","truncated":true}
