{"type":"thinking","text":"The keyFindings are built from `iterationFiles` (the markdown narrative) findings and sources. The delta finding rows aren't used for keyFindings? It uses `iterationFiles` parsed from markdown. The narrative `## Findings` numbered lines become findings; `Sources Consulted` list becomes sources for all findings. So the registry will have 5 keyFindings if the narrative has 5 numbered findings. Good. The delta finding rows satisfy the verifier and the prompt contract.\n\nThe registry `keyFindings` entries have `text` = finding, `sources` = iteration.sources (all sources listed in Sources Consulted). Synthesis closeout's `findingKeys` includes text/title/summary etc. It counts `registryFindingCount`? Let me check `registryEvidence` for research. It likely counts `keyFindings`. If 5, passes. Good.\n\nThe merge reads registry. Good.\n\nNow, the iteration narrative must have `## Findings` with exactly 5 numbered lines at left margin. The `Sources Consulted` section should list the source paths. The reducer also parses `## Ruled Out` and `## Dead Ends` for ruled-out directions. Fine.\n\n### Dashboard\nThe reducer writes dashboard. It may require `deep-research-dashboard.md` template? It generates. Let me not worry.\n\n### Resource map\n`step_emit_resource_map` calls reducer with `--emit-resource-map`; it reads config.resource_map.emit. If true, writes `resource-map.md`. It uses `researchDir` = artifact_dir. The delta sources are repo-relative paths. The resource map may include them. Good.\n\n### Config `resource_map`\nThe config template has no `resource_map` field; step_create_config adds `resource_map.emit`. Add:\n```\n\"resource_map\": { \"emit\": true }\n```\nand `\"resource_map_present\": false`.\nThe reducer at line 179 checks `config.resource_map || config.resourceMap`. Good.\n\n### Dashboard stamp\nThe fanout merge reads the lineage registry and dashboard. The reducer writes both. Good.\n\n### Synthesis closeout event scope\nIt uses `scopeRunId = basename(dirname(stateLog))` = `dsh-live`. The gateway may accept. If it refuses, I'll manually stage a `deep_research.synthesis_complete` event with scope runId = session id and data matching the schema. Let me inspect the schema for synthesis_complete data fields so I can build it if needed. At 510. Let me read."}
