{"type":"thinking","text":"It landed at the lineage root. Good. The write tool resolves simple names against cwd (lineage). The earlier full path created a nested duplicate. I'll leave it for now (or maybe later clean with a move? No).\n\nNow, I need to create the gateway run-open event and call the gateway. Use bash with workdir = repo root? If I run from repo root, `--run-directory` should be the lineage dir (repo-relative or absolute). The gateway needs the run directory. I'll use the absolute lineage path (from the prompt) for reliability, or repo-relative. The gateway resolves `--run-directory` relative to cwd. Use repo-relative full path from repo root. The event file path can be the lineage's `gateway-events/run-open.json` (repo-relative). Let me create it with a node script from repo root. The script reads the config at the lineage path. I'll use a heredoc.\n\nNode script:\n```js\nconst fs = require('fs'), crypto = require('crypto'), path = require('path');\nconst dir = 'specs/.../lineages/dsh-live';\nconst configPath = path.join(dir, 'deep-research-config.json');\nconst raw = fs.readFileSync(configPath);\nconst config = JSON.parse(raw);\nconst sha = v => crypto.createHash('sha256').update(v).digest('hex');\nconst lineage = config.lineage || {};\nconst sessionId = lineage.sessionId;\nconst lineageId = lineage.parentSessionId || sessionId;\nconst generation = Number(lineage.generation) || 1;\nconst configDigest = sha(raw);\nconst topic = ...;\nconst event = { stem: 'deep_research.run_initialized', scope: { runId: sessionId, lineageId }, data: { generation, topic, charterDigest: sha(Buffer.from(JSON.stringify({topic: config.topic, specFolder: config.specFolder || ''}))), configDigest, executorFingerprint: sha(Buffer.from(JSON.stringify(config.executor || {}))), replayFingerprint: sha(Buffer.from(JSON.stringify({runId: sessionId, lineageId, generation, configDigest}))), maxIterations: Number(config.maxIterations), convergencePolicyVersion: 'convergence-policy@' + ((config.antiConvergence && config.antiConvergence.convergenceMode) || 'default') } };\nfs.writeFileSync(path.join(dir,'gateway-events','run-open.json'), JSON.stringify(event));\n```\nThen run gateway:\n`node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/append-mode-event.cjs --mode research --run-directory specs/.../dsh-live --event-json specs/.../dsh-live/gateway-events/run-open.json`\n\nPotential issue: `run-directory` may be resolved relative to cwd. Fine. The gateway's authority root may be `~/.dsh` or repo. Let's see.\n\nI'll run the node script and gateway in one bash call with `set -e` but capture output. Use the repo root as workdir.\n\nLet me also validate JSON. Then run gateway."}
{"type":"tool_call","callId":"call_00_6yxryhcuqTGYIp07yKTu3418","tool":"bash","input":{"command":"set -e\ncd /Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Skilled\nLINEAGE=\"specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/002-cli-deepseek-harness-creation/013-dsh-live-contract-pin/research/fanout-live/lineages/dsh-live\"\nnode - \"$LINEAGE\" <<'EOF'\nconst fs = require('fs');\nconst crypto = require('crypto');\nconst path = require('path');\nconst dir = process.argv[2];\nconst configPath = path.join(dir, 'deep-research-config.json');\nconst raw = fs.readFileSync(configPath);\nconst config = JSON.parse(raw);\nconst sha = (value) => crypto.createHash('sha256').update(value).digest('hex');\nconst lineage = config.lineage || {};\nconst sessionId = lineage.sessionId;\nconst lineageId = lineage.parentSessionId || sessionId;\nconst generation = Number(lineage.generation) || 1;\nconst configDigest = sha(raw);\nconst topic = typeof config.topic === 'string' && config.topic.trim() !== '' && config.topic.length <= 4096\n  ? config.topic\n  : null;\nconst event = {\n  stem: 'deep_research.run_initialized',\n  scope: { runId: sessionId, lineageId },\n  data: {\n    generation,\n    ...(topic === null ? {} : { topic }),\n    charterDigest: sha(Buffer.from(JSON.stringify({ topic: config.topic, specFolder: config.specFolder || '' }))),\n    configDigest,\n    executorFingerprint: sha(Buffer.from(JSON.stringify(config.executor || {}))),\n    replayFingerprint: sha(Buffer.from(JSON.stringify({ runId: sessionId, lineageId, generation, configDigest }))),\n    maxIterations: Number(config.maxIterations),\n    convergencePolicyVersion: 'convergence-policy@' + ((config.antiConvergence && config.antiConvergence.convergenceMode) || 'default'),\n  },\n};\nfs.writeFileSync(path.join(dir, 'gateway-events', 'run-open.json'), JSON.stringify(event));\nconsole.log(JSON.stringify({ configBytes: raw.length, sessionId, lineageId, generation, maxIterations: event.data.maxIterations, topicLength: topic ? topic.length : 0 }));\nEOF\nnode .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/append-mode-event.cjs --mode research --run-directory \"$LINEAGE\" --event-json \"$LINEAGE/gateway-events/run-open.json\"\necho \"GATEWAY_EXIT:$?\"","description":"Open research run through append gateway"}}
