{"type":"tool_call","callId":"call_00_SVPEexMWIBgLLExP2u0R5965","tool":"write","input":{"file_path":"deep-research-strategy.md","content":"---\ntitle: Deep Research Strategy - DSH route patch declarations\ndescription: Session tracking for the dsh-live fan-out lineage.\nimportance_tier: normal\ncontextType: planning\n---\n\n# Deep Research Strategy - DSH route patch declarations\n\n## 1. OVERVIEW\n\nOne-iteration factual audit of the two checked-in DeepSeek Harness route patches. The session answers what each patch declares and whether the two declarations agree.\n\n## 2. TOPIC\n\nWhat do the two checked-in DeepSeek Harness route patches under `.dsh/patches/` declare (endpoint, model id, reasoning effort, compat flags), and do they agree with each other? Read the files; answer in under 200 words.\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:key-questions -->\n## 3. KEY QUESTIONS (remaining)\n\n- [ ] What endpoint, model id, reasoning effort, and compat flags does `.dsh/patches/route-llmgateway-deepseek.patch.yml` declare?\n- [ ] What endpoint, model id, reasoning effort, and compat flags does `.dsh/patches/route-opencode-go-deepseek.patch.yml` declare?\n- [ ] Do the two route patches agree, and where do they differ?\n- [ ] Which route does the repository document as unverified pending a keyed run?\n<!-- /ANCHOR:key-questions -->\n\n---\n\n## 4. NON-GOALS\n\n- Do not run a keyed probe or any `dsh` dispatch.\n- Do not modify either patch, any packet file, or any file outside this lineage.\n- Do not assess whether either endpoint actually works; only record what the files declare and how the repository labels verification state.\n\n---\n\n## 5. STOP CONDITIONS\n\n- `config.maxIterations` is 1, so the loop stops at the cap after iteration 1.\n- Stop early only on unrecoverable state corruption or an append-gateway refusal.\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:answered-questions -->\n## 6. ANSWERED QUESTIONS\n\n[None yet -- populated as iterations answer questions]\n<!-- /ANCHOR:answered-questions -->\n\n---\n\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n<!-- ANCHOR:what-worked -->\n## 7. WHAT WORKED\n\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\n<!-- /ANCHOR:what-worked -->\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:what-failed -->\n## 8. WHAT FAILED\n\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\n<!-- /ANCHOR:what-failed -->\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:exhausted-approaches -->\n## 9. EXHAUSTED APPROACHES (do not retry)\n\n[None. A single direct-read iteration should answer the topic.]\n<!-- /ANCHOR:exhausted-approaches -->\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:ruled-out-directions -->\n## 10. RULED OUT DIRECTIONS\n\n[None yet]\n<!-- /ANCHOR:ruled-out-directions -->\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:divergence-frontier -->\n## 10A. SATURATED DIRECTIONS AND DIVERGENCE FRONTIER\n\n- Completed pivots: 0\n- Failed pivots: 0\n- Audited overrides: 0\n- Saturated: none yet\n- Pivot lineage: none yet\n- Remaining frontier: none recorded\n<!-- /ANCHOR:divergence-frontier -->\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:carried-forward-open-questions -->\n## 11A. CARRIED-FORWARD OPEN QUESTIONS\n\n[None yet]\n<!-- /ANCHOR:carried-forward-open-questions -->\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n## 11. NEXT FOCUS\n\nNo next iteration: `maxIterations` is 1. The factual answer is complete when iteration 1 records the declarations and the comparison.\n<!-- /ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n\n---\n\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n## 12. KNOWN CONTEXT\n\nThe two route patches and their prior composed-config evidence are already read in this session:\n\n- `.dsh/patches/route-llmgateway-deepseek.patch.yml`\n- `.dsh/patches/route-opencode-go-deepseek.patch.yml`\n- `.dsh/README.md` (exactly one route patch per dispatch; OpenCode Go endpoint unverified)\n- `.dsh/SYNC.md` (both patches hand-authored; OpenCode Go endpoint unverified until a keyed run proves it)\n- `specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/002-cli-deepseek-harness-creation/004-dsh-runtime-folder-and-patches/evidence/dump-config-llmgateway.txt`\n- `specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime