nd before Section 12 Open Questions. Populate it from `{state_paths.registry}` with saturated directions, pivots taken, evidence and Council artifact references, pivot failures and audited overrides, and the remaining frontier.\n.skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research-auto.yaml:2222:            1. Create research/research.md following 17-section template\n.skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research-auto.yaml:2227:            6. After the mandatory `## Eliminated Alternatives` section and before Section 12 Open Questions, add `## Divergence Map` with saturated directions, pivots taken, evidence and Council artifact references, pivot failures and audited overrides, and the remaining frontier from `{state_paths.registry}`.\n.skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research-confirm.yaml:1657:            6. Preserve the mandatory `## Eliminated Alternatives` section, then add or replace `## Divergence Map` immediately after it and before Section 12 Open Questions. Populate it from `{state_paths.registry}` with saturated directions, pivots taken, evidence and Council artifact references, pivot failures and audited overrides, and the remaining frontier.\n.skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research-confirm.yaml:1660:            1. Create research/research.md following 17-section template\n.skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research-confirm.yaml:1664:            5. After the mandatory `## Eliminated Alternatives` section and before Section 12 Open Questions, add `## Divergence Map` with saturated directions, pivots taken, evidence and Council artifact references, pivot failures and audited overrides, and the remaining frontier from `{state_paths.registry}`.\n"}
